                  %mrow
                    %mi ∅
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \emptyset \in \mathcal{C}
              be an object. The following are equivalent:
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
