              of composites
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:OneComposite"} (?)
              and
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:OtherComposite"} (?)
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+natural+transformation"} enriched natural transformation
          %p
            Conversely, example
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#NaturalTransformationsViaEnds"}
            says that
